            "review_title": "Review at Coco A",
            "review_text": "Philip D\n21 contributions\n0\nGood location, Great local food\nDec 2018 • Friends\nWe entertained some guest here. A bit of a challenge as they did not eat pork or beef (which removed 80% of the menu selection). \nBut the food we ordered, all local dishes were great. We all enjoyed the dishes. \nHighly recommend the prawn fritters, mixed salad and chicken rice.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 12, 2018",
