            "review_title": "Review at Coco A",
            "review_text": "Minh-Ha N\n13 contributions\n0\nGood food\nJul 2018 • Family\nMaybe not well known by tourists based on the number of the review here, but this restaurant is quite famous among local people. They serve traditional Vietnamese dishes. The taste is authentic and very delicious. Very much mother’s food alike. Nice presentation, and the portion is big. \n\nThe restaurant itself is clean, with air con, pleasant decoration. The service is quick but the staff is not very responsive. \n\nIn general we were very much satisfied, would recommend this restaurant for real Vietnamese food (i’m Vietnamese so i know what i’m talking about :) )\nRead more\nWritten July 27, 2018",
            "rating": 4.0,
