            "review_text": "TraavelGeek\nBengaluru, India505 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese cuisine but pricey\nSep 2017 • Family\nWe were invited by a local host for the dinner as we are vegetarians. Not much vegetarian varieties though but seemed to be authentic Vietnamese cuisine. We had lot of food which I don't remember the names for. The menu is exhaustive but quite pricey. They don't serve water, may be Vietnamese way so you buy them more and more. The ambience is nice. The service was good since we were with a local host.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 16, 2017",
