            "review_title": "Review at Coco A",
            "review_text": "VietTran263\nHanoi, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nPoor service, Stuffy setting, Decent Food\nFeb 2017 • Business\nWent to Coco A the first time for a business lunch with 3 other people in February 2017. \nWe were arranged a table on the 1st floor near the entrance of the restaurant and I couldn't help it but to find the setting to be extremely stuffy and stressful as Coco A tried to squeeze way too many tables in a small space. \n\nThe service was really poor as the staff was forgetful, loud and we had to wait for almost an hour for our food to come. \n\nThe food was decent, however, were overpriced for the quality. \n\nI will not return.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 24, 2017",
